[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14047.51, "timestamp": "03:54:07", "text": "，我先來。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14057.349, "timestamp": "03:54:17", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14059.59, "timestamp": "03:54:19", "text": "等等。等等，等等，等等。別等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14076.95, "timestamp": "03:54:36", "text": "我了。我覺得你來不了。他還在PVP呢。我的天，真是個混蛋。我什麼都沒有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14077.269, "timestamp": "03:54:37", "text": "拜託，我忘了把它放進"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14082.389, "timestamp": "03:54:42", "text": "保險箱裡了。真他媽的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14096.309, "timestamp": "03:54:56", "text": "我的螢幕怎麼了？哦，我看到你的"}]